        "why": "<span class=\"pl\">Jestem programistą.</span> A profession, a role or an identity after <span class=\"pl\">być</span> goes in the instrumental. An adjective does not: <span class=\"pl\">Jestem zmęczony</span> (nominative)." },
      { "id": "irr-8", "kind": "choice", "q": "\"There is no coffee.\" Which is right?",
